OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787100481
OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FFormer boxer Wladimir Klitschko said
OL,7,Fhis family is "going through a time of
OL,8,Fprofound shock and grief" following
OL,9,Fthe death of his ex-partner Hayden
OL,10,FPanettiere.
OL,12,FThe Nashville and Heroes actor, aged
OL,13,F36, who was the mother of their
OL,14,Fdaughter Kaya, died on Sunday after a
OL,15,Freported cardiac arrest.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
