FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787100481
OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FPolice said there were "no signs of
OL,7,Ffoul play or suspicious
OL,8,Fcircumstances", while the Greenwood
OL,9,FCounty Coroner's office confirmed
OL,10,Fthere were "no signs of trauma".
OL,11,FInvestigations remain ongoing.
OL,13,FIn a memoir published earlier this
OL,14,Fyear, Panettiere opened up about her
OL,15,Fdifficulties with mental health and
OL,16,Fthe loss of her younger brother,
OL,17,FJansen, who died of a heart condition
OL,18,Fin 2023, aged 28.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787100481
OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FShe also talked about her decision to
OL,7,Fgive full custody of her daughter to
OL,8,FKlitschko.
OL,10,FIn a post on Instagram, Klitschko
OL,11,Fwrote: "The announcement of Hayden's
OL,12,Ftragic death saddens me deeply. She
OL,13,Fleft this world far too soon. Hayden
OL,14,Fwas, although no longer my partner, an
OL,15,Fimportant part of my life and the
OL,16,Fmother of our daughter, Kaya.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787100481
OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,F"She built an incredible career
OL,7,Fthrough immense talent, while also
OL,8,Ffacing the darker sides of a very
OL,9,Fdemanding industry. Nothing will erase
OL,10,Fthe times we shared or the place she
OL,11,Fhad in our lives."
OL,13,FHe also extended his "deepest
OL,14,Fcondolences" to Panettiere's parents,
OL,15,Ffriends and fans.
OL,17,F"To our daughter Kaya," he continued,
OL,18,F"I will always speak of her mother
OL,19,Fwith respect and make sure she
OL,20,Fremembers the person she was."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
