OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FEmergency crews responded to a 911
OL,7,Fcall from an acquaintance of
OL,8,FPanettiere about a "reported cardiac
OL,9,Farrest" in Greenville on Sunday
OL,10,Fafternoon, the coroner's office said.
OL,12,FThe California resident was found
OL,13,Funresponsive inside the South Carolina
OL,14,Fapartment complex "where she had been
OL,15,Ftemporarily staying".
OL,17,FFirst responders tried to resuscitate
OL,18,Fher, although this was unsuccessful,
OL,19,Fand she was pronounced dead at the
OL,20,Fscene.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
