OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FHer Nashville co-star Connie Britton
OL,7,Fwas among those "heartbroken" by the
OL,8,Floss.
OL,10,FBritton said she had "no words" after
OL,11,FPanettiere's death, hailing her as
OL,12,F"bursting with brilliance".
OL,14,FThe Emmy-nominated actress, who
OL,15,Fappeared alongside Panettiere in the
OL,16,FUS drama for nearly five years, shared
OL,17,Fimages of the pair on set.
OL,19,F"This was Hayden. Bursting with
OL,20,Fbrilliance, shining so bright," she
OL,21,Fwrote.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
