OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FThe 59-year-old actress, also known
OL,7,Ffor Friday Night Lights and American
OL,8,FHorror Story, continued: "I have no
OL,9,Fwords for this sad song. Just
OL,10,Fheartbreak."
OL,12,FCharles Esten, who played Deacon
OL,13,FClayborne on Nashville, recalled the
OL,14,Ffirst time he met Panettiere in a
OL,15,Flengthy social media tribute.
OL,17,F"We became fast friends, working very
OL,18,Fhard to play those 2 troubled
OL,19,FNashvillians, but always having fun
OL,20,Fand laughing a whole lot along the
OL,21,Fway," he wrote.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
