OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787100481
OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,F"She was, of course, extraordinarily
OL,7,Ftalented, infusing her larger-than-
OL,8,Flife character with all the heart,
OL,9,Fcharisma, humour, whip-smart
OL,10,Fintelligence, and flat-out magic that
OL,11,Fwere, alongside whatever troubles and
OL,12,Fpain she carried, a part of her own
OL,13,Fpersonal palette."
OL,15,FPanettiere, who played Kirby Reed in
OL,16,FScream 4 and Scream VI, was remembered
OL,17,Ffondly by co-stars from the horror
OL,18,Ffranchise.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
