OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FEmma Roberts, who appeared alongside
OL,7,FPanettiere in films such as Scream 4
OL,8,Fand The Architect, shared snaps of the
OL,9,Ftwo sharing an embrace.
OL,11,FRoberts wrote: "Rest in peace my sweet
OL,12,Ffriend. You are so loved and will be
OL,13,Fforever missed."
OL,15,FNico Tortorella, who also appeared in
OL,16,FScream 4, said: "I keep trying to
OL,17,Fwrite something, but there are too few
OL,18,Fwords for you."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
