OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FBeneath a photo of himself with
OL,7,FPanettiere, the 38-year-old actor
OL,8,Fadded: "I love you, I miss you and I'm
OL,9,Fsorry."
OL,11,FKim Cattrall, who starred alongside
OL,12,FPanettiere in Ice Princess, shared a
OL,13,Fpicture of her with "sweet Hayden" and
OL,14,Fsaid she was "gone far too soon".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
