OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FActor Tim Allen said in a post on X:
OL,7,F"I am shocked and so sad as the
OL,8,Fpassing of Hayden Panettiere. She
OL,9,Fplayed my daughter in the movie Joe
OL,10,FSomebody. The fondest memories of that
OL,11,Fmovie were moments around her. She is
OL,12,Fa wonder and my prayers are with her
OL,13,Ffamily."
OL,15,FBrittany Snow, who played Panettiere's
OL,16,Fon-screen sister for three years in
OL,17,Fthe TV show Guiding Light, posted a
OL,18,Fthrowback photo of the pair as
OL,19,Fchildren to her Instagram stories,
OL,20,Fcaptioning it: "I was lucky enough to
OL,21,Fplay your sister for 3 years.
OL,26,@|D@POU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
