OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,F"I related to you so much in so many
OL,7,Fways. Ways that I never even told you.
OL,8,FYour talent was remarkable & so was
OL,9,Fyour determination to be a bold,
OL,10,Fbright shining light. And you were."
OL,12,FShe said Panettiere was "always
OL,13,Fsupportive, curious, funny and brave",
OL,14,Fadding: "You will always be remembered
OL,15,Fundoubtedly for your undeniable
OL,16,Fstrength and spirit."
