OL,3,CWladimir Klitschko in 'profound shock'
OL,4,Cover death of ex Hayden Panettiere
OL,6,FPanettiere started acting as a child,
OL,7,Fappearing in soap operas before
OL,8,Fgaining wider recognition for her role
OL,9,Fin the 2000 sports drama Remember the
OL,10,FTitans, alongside Denzel Washington
OL,11,Fand as the voice of Dot in Pixar's
OL,12,F1998 film A Bug's Life.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/15
